    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "American Airlines\nInternational Menu\nFIRST CLASS",
      "DINNER SERVICE\nTO START\nAn assortment of warm roasted Nuts\nto accompany your preferred Cocktail or Beverage\nENTREES\nCHATEAUBRIAND\nTenderloin of Beef coated with fresh Sage\nand complemented by a Port Wine Demi-Glace\nAccompanied by seasonal Vegetables\nTHE CAVIAR CART\nSevruga Malossol Caviar\nFrom the Caspian Sea, presented with traditional Garnishes\nand Blini or Toast Points\nGRILLED VEAL\nA tender grilled Veal Chop seasoned with Thyme\nand enhanced by a distinctive Balsamic Vinaigrette\nOffered with crisp Cabbage Slaw and Polenta Chips\nAPPETIZER SALAD\nCrisp Romaine and Leaf Lettuce\ngarnished with half of a fresh Maine Lobster Tail and Claw\nOffered with a choice of\ncreamy Herb Dressing or Ginger Vinaigrette\nWarm Breads, freshly baked on board\nDESTINATION FEATURE\nThis specially created entree is on the enclosed Feature Card\nYou may wish to choose the fruit and cheese course in lieu of the sorbet and entree.\nIf you select this lighter alternative, selected chocolates, hot beverages and cordials\nwill be served immediately following the fruit and cheese.\nSORBET COURSE\nGrapefruit Sorbet\nQUICK CUISINE\nAs a special service to you, our flight attendants are pleased to present\nthis complete and elegant meal, offered all at once and available at your convenience.\nSevruga Malossol Caviar\nMARINATED SALMON\nFillet of Salmon presented chilled on a bed of fresh Cucumbers,\ndressed with a warm Dill Vinaigrette\nand served with a Salad of Boston and Romaine Lettuce\nApple Macadamia Nut Pastry\nCALK 1.204\n21013-1\nC.ILK. 1.7104\n3 1013-1\nDEUTSCH"
    ],
